<title>USA: F &amp; M Bancorp in affiliation agreement.</title>
<headline>F &amp; M Bancorp in affiliation agreement.</headline>
<dateline>KAUKANA, Wis. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>F &amp; M Bancorporation Inc said Wednesday it signed a letter of intent for Wisconsin-based Prairie City Bank to affiliate with the company.</p>
<p>Prairie City Bank is headquartered in Prairie du Chien, Wisc. and has assets of about $85 million with five locations.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
